# 5. Recommended stack

Prefer:

* Next.js
* React
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS or CSS Modules
* Framer Motion only if useful and not excessive
* SVG/CSS/Canvas for the first central visual
* Three.js later only if needed

Do not introduce complex dependencies unless needed.

For the first prototype, CSS/SVG layers are enough to imitate the orb and rings.

