# 8. UI structure

Every main mobile screen should include:

* RESONA logo at top
* short subtitle indicating current state
* central Sound Matter object
* minimal status indicator
* matter selector
* Capture and Merge buttons

Basic layout:

```txt
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ top controls / status        │
│ RESONA                       │
│ subtitle                     │
│                             │
│ central sound matter         │
│                             │
│ hint / timer / resonance     │
│ level / loops / meter        │
│                             │
│ matter selector              │
│ Capture / Merge buttons      │
└─────────────────────────────┘
```

The UI must be mobile-first.

