# 10. Core components

## ResonanceApp

Responsibilities:

* own `mode`
* own `matter`
* own mock state
* handle Capture and Merge button actions
* pass state to child components

## AppShell

Responsibilities:

* mobile app container
* background gradient
* safe spacing
* vertical layout
* max width
* dark visual base

## Header

Responsibilities:

* logo
* subtitle
* optional left control icon
* optional right menu/share icon

## SoundMatterCanvas

Responsibilities:

* render Solo/Capture central matter
* support Glass/Liquid/Bloom variants
* show recording ring if capture state
* show melody trace if capture state
* show orbital rings and glow

Do not make this a plain circle. It must feel like a luminous material object.

## MergeNetwork

Responsibilities:

* render participant nodes
* render central shared resonance orb
* render connecting light lines
* render orbital paths

## MatterSelector

Responsibilities:

* show Glass / Liquid / Bloom
* highlight selected matter
* update matter state

## LevelMeter

Responsibilities:

* show segmented audio level bars
* display percentage

## ResonanceMeter

Responsibilities:

* show resonance percentage
* waveform-like bars
* status caption

## PrimaryActions

Responsibilities:

* show Capture and Merge buttons
* highlight active mode

## LoopChips

Responsibilities:

* show loop chips in Capture mode
* show add button
* support remove handler later

